\newlabel{fig:pact_overview}{{2}{4}{\textbf {Parallel Continuous Thought (PaCT).} At each reasoning stage, a set of latent reasoning states is synthesized in parallel from the current textual context, refined through bidirectional interaction, and used to condition subsequent autoregressive decoding.\relax }{figure.caption.2}{}}
